      * Runtime di Babele in COBOL
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. BABELE-RUNTIME.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 BUFFER PIC X(256).
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 INPUT-STRING PIC X(256).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING INPUT-STRING.
           MOVE INPUT-STRING TO BUFFER.
           DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(BUFFER).
           GOBACK.
       END PROGRAM BABELE-RUNTIME.
